    <TextEncoding>134217984</TextEncoding>
    <SourceLine>Sub TextChanged()</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>If Not UI_UpdateActive Then</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>DEV_P2P_Freq = Tf_Freq.Text</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine></SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>'Send automatically when the value is complete:</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>'9 digits = sub-GHz (150 - 960 MHz), 10 digits = 2.4GHz (2400000000 - 2483000000 Hz).</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>'A 9 digit value starting with 24 could still become a 2.4GHz value, it is sent with the Enter key.</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>If (DEV_P2P_Freq.Length = 9 And Not DEV_P2P_Freq.BeginsWith("24")) Or DEV_P2P_Freq.Length = 10 Then</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>UART_Set_P2P_Freq</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>End If</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>End If</SourceLine>
    <SourceLine>End Sub</SourceLine>
   </ItemSource>
